BZbGbvLJ"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# dcounts_sum_inv = (counts * dprobs).sum(1, keepdims=True)"],"metadata":{"id":"vAGzEK4Yb_pu"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["### Example 2: `bnvar_inv`\n"],"metadata":{"id":"_QNEgQxEbM-l"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# bnvar_inv = (bnvar + 1e-5)**-0.5\n","# dbnvar_inv = (bndiff * dbnraw).sum(0, keepdims=True) # dbnvar_inv"],"metadata":{"id":"SIWJUvYXdKhk"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# Derivative: logits = h @ W2 + b2"],"metadata":{"id":"iX6Cw4dtaxKB"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# Derivative of h, W2 and b2\n","# logits = h @ W2 + b2 # output layer\n","# dlogits.shape # torch.Size([32, 27])\n","# h.shape       # torch.Size([32, 64])\n","# W2.shape      # torch.Size([64, 27])\n","# b2.shape      # torch.Size([27])"],"metadata":{"id":"T-Gg8eSva6IV"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Toy Version"],"metadata":{"id":"a_lA7ZT7a9Xr"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["\"\"\"\n","l11 l12 = h11 h12 * W11 W12 + b1 b2\n","l21 l22   h21 h22   W21 W22   b1 b2\n","bias becomes a row and is being broadcasted vertically\n","-------------------------------------\n","l11 = h11W11 + h12W21 + b1\n","l12 = h11W12 + h12W22 + b2\n","l21 = h21W11 + h22W21 + b1\n","l22 = h21W12 + h22W22 + b2\n","-------------------------------------\n","1. for h11\n","dL/dh11 = affects l11 and l12\n","locl_der `dl11/dh11`  and `dl12/dh11`\n","dL/dh11 = (dL/dl11)*(W11) + (dL/dl12)*(W12)\n","--------------\n","2. for h12\n","dL/dh12 = (dL/dl11)*(W21) + (dL/dl12)*(W22)\n","--------------\n","3. for h21\n","dL/dh21 = (dL/dl21)*(W11) + (dL/dl22)*(W12)\n","--------------\n","4. for h22\n","dL/dh22 = (dL/dl2)*(W21) + (dL/dl22)*(W22)\n","-------------------------------------\n","dL/dh = | dL/dh11  dL/dh12 |\n","        | dL/dh21  dL/dh22 |\n","      = | dL/dl11  dL/dl12 | * | W11  W21 |\n","        | dL/dl21  dL/dl22 |   | W12  W21 |\n","      = | dL/dl11  dL/dl12 | * | W11  W21 |\n","        | dL/dl21  dL/dl22 |   | W12  W21 |\n","Notice Wxx is transposed\n","dL/dh = dL/dl @ W2^T\n","--------------\n","dL/dW2 = h^T @ dL/dl\n","--------------\n","dL/db2 = dL/dl . sum(0) # (sum the columns)\n","\"\"\""],"metadata":{"id":"z5zGOjPOa_F8"},"execution_count":null,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["Actual Derivative"],"metadata":{"id":"5m4Lfrzga_h_"}},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"metadata":{"id":"PZ4UYbgqatn4"},"outputs":[],"source":["dh = dlogits @ W2.T\n","dW2 = h.T @ dlogits\n","db2 = dlogits.sum(0)"]}]}